id: tactician
name: Tactician
order: 6
category: mind
# A Factor Trait replaces a Secondary Racial Trait - Secondary, then, unless it names a Primary one to replace.
importance: secondary
description: >
  Your analytical mind is beyond compare.
text: >
  Tactician (Mind): Your analytical mind is beyond compare.
  (1)-[Passive]: Increase the Dice Score of all of your Skills that use your Scholarship Attribute by 1.
  (2)-[Passive]: Increase your Scholarship Modifier by 1(T).
  (3)-[Triggered, 1/Round]: When you use the Analysis Maneuver, target an Ally who is not at Long Range. Increase their Combat Rolls by 1/4 (rounded up) of your Scholarship Modifier until the start of your next turn.
  (4)-[Triggered, 1/Encounter]: When you use the Analysis Maneuver, enter the Superior State until the end of your next turn.

---

[passive]
# (1), (2)
skills.scholarship += 1;
scholarship.mod += 1(T);

# (3) Captain's (3), by the Scholarship Modifier (chat.mjs mutationRally). Automatic by default, its Triggered/Automatic button.
[triggered/analysis, 1/round, effect 3]
mutationRally(scholarship);

# (4) Automatic by default, its Triggered/Automatic button.
[triggered/analysis, 1/encounter, effect 4]
enterState(superior, 1, next-turn);
